msgid "System Updates"
msgstr "Ngā whakahōunga pūnaha"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update"
msgstr "Fluff Linux Update"

msgid "Keep Fluff Linux secure and up to date by installing system updates."
msgstr "Kia haumaru, kia hou tonu a Fluff Linux mā te tāuta whakahōunga pūnaha."

msgid "System last updated: %1 (%2)"
msgstr "Te whakahōunga whakamutunga o te pūnaha: %1 (%2)"

msgid "Check for Updates"
msgstr "Tirohia ngā whakahōunga"

msgid "Install Updates"
msgstr "Tāutahia ngā whakahōunga"

msgid "View Updates"
msgstr "Tirohia te rārangi whakahōunga"

msgid "Change view"
msgstr "Hurihia te tirohanga"

msgid "Updates to Install"
msgstr "Ngā whakahōunga hei tāuta"

msgid "Package details are unavailable."
msgstr "Kāore ngā taipitopito mōkī i te wātea."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update is still under development. If you encounter an issue, please report it on our GitHub page."
msgstr "Kei te whakawhanaketia tonutia a Fluff Linux Update. Ki te kitea he raru, tukuna mai he pūrongo ki tō mātou whārangi GitHub."

msgid "System updates were installed successfully."
msgstr "Kua oti pai te tāuta ngā whakahōunga pūnaha."

msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

msgid "No network connection!"
msgstr "Kāore he hononga whatunga!"

msgid "Network connection is limited. If you are not connected to an organizational network, please check your internet connection."
msgstr "He iti te hononga whatunga. Mēnā kāore koe i te hono ki tētahi whatunga whakahaere, tirohia tō hononga ipurangi."

msgid "pacman process is already running."
msgstr "Kei te haere kē te tukanga pacman."

msgid "The update process could not be started."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tīmata te tukanga whakahōu."

msgid "The update process could not be cancelled."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te whakakore te tukanga whakahōu."

msgid "Connection failed while downloading updates. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "I rahua te hononga i te tikiake whakahōunga. Tirohia tō whatunga, ka ngana anō."

msgid "The system update failed."
msgstr "I rahua te whakahōunga pūnaha."

msgid "Downloading updates…"
msgstr "Kei te tikiake whakahōunga…"

msgid "Installing updates…"
msgstr "Kei te tāuta whakahōunga…"

msgid "%1 / %2 downloaded"
msgstr "%1 / %2 kua tikiake"

msgid "%1/%2 updates installed"
msgstr "%1/%2 whakahōunga kua tāuta"

msgid "Updates are currently being installed. Please avoid powering off or restarting the computer until installation is complete. Interrupting the update may damage system files."
msgstr "Kei te tāutahia ngā whakahōunga. Kaua e whakaweto, e tīmata anō rānei i te rorohiko kia oti rā anō te tāuta. Mā te haukoti i te whakahōunga e tūkino pea ngā kōnae pūnaha."

msgid "The battery is low. Please connect your computer to a charger while installing updates."
msgstr "He iti te pūhiko. Tūhonohia tō rorohiko ki tētahi pūwhakahiko i te wā e tāuta whakahōunga ana."

msgid "Update process was cancelled"
msgstr "Kua whakakorea te tukanga whakahōu"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Whakakore"

msgid "Checking for updates…"
msgstr "Kei te tirotiro whakahōunga…"

msgid "System updates are available"
msgstr "Kei te wātea ngā whakahōunga pūnaha"

msgid "Download size: %1"
msgstr "Rahi tikiake: %1"

msgid "Storage required for system updates: %1"
msgstr "Mokowā e hiahiatia ana mō ngā whakahōunga pūnaha: %1"

msgid "Storage freed after update: %1"
msgstr "Mokowā ka whakawāteatia i muri i te whakahōunga: %1"

msgid "No additional download required"
msgstr "Kāore he tikiake anō e hiahiatia ana"

msgid "The update checker could not be started. Make sure pacman-contrib is installed."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tīmata te kaitirotiro whakahōunga. Me whakarite kua tāutahia a pacman-contrib."

msgid "The update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "I mutu ohorere te tirotiro whakahōunga."

msgid "An unknown error has occurred. Please report this issue on our GitHub page for assistance."
msgstr "Kua puta he hapa tē mōhiotia. Tukuna mai he pūrongo ki tō mātou whārangi GitHub kia āwhinatia ai."

msgid "No internet connection. Check your network and try again."
msgstr "Kāore he hononga ipurangi. Tirohia tō whatunga, ka ngana anō."

msgid "The repository servers could not be reached. Try again later or check your mirror configuration."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te toro atu ki ngā tūmau putunga. Ngana anō ā muri ake, tirohia rānei tō whirihoranga whakaata."

msgid "Authorization error, please try again."
msgstr "He hapa whakamanatanga, ngana anō."

msgid "The privileged update check stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "I mutu ohorere te tirotiro whakahōunga whai mana teitei."

msgid "The privileged update check could not be started."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tīmata te tirotiro whakahōunga whai mana teitei."

msgid "System was not previously updated."
msgstr "Kāore anō te pūnaha kia whakahōutia."

msgid "The last update information could not be read."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te pānui ngā mōhiohio mō te whakahōunga whakamutunga."

msgid "The last update information is invalid."
msgstr "He muhu ngā mōhiohio mō te whakahōunga whakamutunga."

msgid "Updates were not installed on this system"
msgstr "Kāore anō kia tāutahia he whakahōunga ki tēnei pūnaha"

msgid "To update the system, check for available updates using the button below."
msgstr "Hei whakahōu i te pūnaha, tirohia ngā whakahōunga e wātea ana mā te pātene i raro."

msgid "Update date available"
msgstr "Kei te wātea te rā whakahōunga"

msgid "Updated recently"
msgstr "Kātahi anō ka whakahōutia"

msgid "System is up to date"
msgstr "Kei te hou te pūnaha"

msgid "Last update was installed more than a month ago"
msgstr "Neke atu i te marama mai i te tāutanga o te whakahōunga whakamutunga"

msgid "Last update was installed more than three months ago"
msgstr "Neke atu i te toru marama mai i te tāutanga o te whakahōunga whakamutunga"

msgid "%1 second ago"
msgid_plural "%1 seconds ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 hēkona ki muri"
msgstr[1] "%1 hēkona ki muri"

msgid "%1 minute ago"
msgid_plural "%1 minutes ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 meneti ki muri"
msgstr[1] "%1 meneti ki muri"

msgid "%1 hour ago"
msgid_plural "%1 hours ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 hāora ki muri"
msgstr[1] "%1 hāora ki muri"

msgid "%1 day ago"
msgid_plural "%1 days ago"
msgstr[0] "%1 rā ki muri"
msgstr[1] "%1 rā ki muri"

msgid "Action is required"
msgstr "Me mahi"

msgid "Action is required!"
msgstr "Me mahi!"

msgid "Action required"
msgstr "He mahi e hiahiatia ana"

msgid "Fluff Linux Update cannot continue because the upcoming update requires removing “%1”, which is a protected system package. Removing it could prevent Fluff Linux from working correctly. Please report this issue on GitHub for assistance."
msgstr "Kāore e taea e Fluff Linux Update te haere tonu nā te mea me tango te mōkī pūnaha tiakina “%1” mō te whakahōunga e whai ake nei. Mā te tango e kore pea a Fluff Linux e mahi tika. Tukuna he pūrongo ki GitHub mō te āwhina."

msgid "To allow the system to install updates, Fluff Linux Update needs to remove “%1”. Removing this package may affect related software. If you are not sure, please report the issue on GitHub for help."
msgstr "Hei tāuta whakahōunga pūnaha, me tango e Fluff Linux Update a “%1”. Ka pā pea te tangohanga ki ētahi atu pūmanawa. Ki te kore koe e tino mōhio, tukuna he pūrongo ki GitHub mō te āwhina."

msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Whakaae"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Katia"

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, %1 was automatically removed after it was deemed safe to remove."
msgstr "Hei haere tonu ngā whakahōunga pūnaha, kua tangohia aunoatia a %1 i muri i te whakatau he haumaru te tango."

msgid "To allow system updates to continue, the following packages were automatically removed after they were deemed safe to remove: %1"
msgstr "Hei haere tonu ngā whakahōunga pūnaha, kua tangohia aunoatia ēnei mōkī i muri i te whakatau he haumaru te tango: %1"

msgid "A file conflict was detected and resolved. %1 was renamed to %2. The update process has restarted."
msgstr "Kua kitea, kua whakatikaina he taupatupatu kōnae. Kua whakaingoatia anō a %1 hei %2. Kua tīmata anō te tukanga whakahōu."

msgid "The conflicting package could not be removed. Please seek support."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tango te mōkī taupatupatu. Rapua he tautoko."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system."
msgstr "Kāore i taea e Fluff Linux Update te manatoko i te kī waitohu o te putunga FluffNet. Kua whakamutua te whakahōunga hei tiaki i tō pūnaha."

msgid "Fluff Linux Update could not verify the FluffNet repository signing key. The update was stopped to protect your system. This may indicate a network problem, an unavailable FluffNet server, an expired or rotated signing key, a repository configuration problem, an unexpected key, or a possible repository compromise. Do not manually accept an unexpected key unless Fluff Linux publishes verified instructions."
msgstr "Kāore i taea e Fluff Linux Update te manatoko i te kī waitohu o te putunga FluffNet. Kua whakamutua te whakahōunga hei tiaki i tō pūnaha. He raru whatunga pea, kāore te tūmau FluffNet i te wātea, kua pau te wā, kua whakakapia rānei te kī waitohu, he hapa whirihoranga putunga, he kī ohorere, kua whakaekehia rānei te putunga. Kaua e whakaae ā-ringa ki tētahi kī ohorere ki te kore a Fluff Linux e whakaputa tohutohu kua manatoko."

msgid "Repository: %1"
msgstr "Putunga: %1"

msgid "The official FluffNet repository signing key was verified and added to Pacman."
msgstr "Kua manatokohia te kī waitohu mana o te putunga FluffNet, kua tāpirihia ki Pacman."

msgid "Technical details"
msgstr "Ngā taipitopito hangarau"

msgid "Repository signing-key verification technical details"
msgstr "Ngā taipitopito hangarau mō te manatoko kī waitohu putunga"

msgid "Failure category: %1"
msgstr "Kāwai rahunga: %1"

msgid "Expected fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Tapumati e tūmanakohia ana: %1"

msgid "Received fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Tapumati kua whiwhi: %1"

msgid "Requested signing-key fingerprint: %1"
msgstr "Tapumati kī waitohu i tonoa: %1"

msgid "Pacman exit status: %1"
msgstr "Tūnga putanga Pacman: %1"

msgid "FLU version: %1"
msgstr "Putanga FLU: %1"

msgid "Fluff Linux version: %1"
msgstr "Putanga Fluff Linux: %1"

msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Ngana anō"

msgid "Copy Technical Details"
msgstr "Tāruatia ngā taipitopito hangarau"

msgid "Open an Issue on GitHub"
msgstr "Whakatuwheratia he pūrongo ki GitHub"

msgid "There is not enough free storage to continue the update. Free up space and try again."
msgstr "Kāore e rahi te mokowā wātea hei haere tonu te whakahōunga. Whakawāteatia he mokowā, ka ngana anō."

msgid "A package or repository signature could not be verified. The update was stopped. Check your system date and keyring, then try again."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te manatoko he waitohu mōkī, putunga rānei. Kua whakamutua te whakahōunga. Tirohia te rā pūnaha me te huinga kī, ka ngana anō."

msgid "The package database is damaged or unreadable. The update was stopped. Please seek support before repairing the database."
msgstr "Kua kino te pātengi raraunga mōkī, kāore rānei e taea te pānui. Kua whakamutua te whakahōunga. Rapua he tautoko i mua i te whakatika i te pātengi raraunga."

msgid "A downloaded package is damaged or incomplete. The update was stopped. Please try again or use a different mirror."
msgstr "Kua kino, kāore rānei i oti tētahi mōkī kua tikiake. Kua whakamutua te whakahōunga. Ngana anō, whakamahia rānei tētahi atu whakaata."

msgid "The update could not read or write required files. Check filesystem permissions and disk health, then try again."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te pānui, te tuhi rānei i ngā kōnae e hiahiatia ana mō te whakahōunga. Tirohia ngā whakaaetanga pūnaha kōnae me te hauora kōpae, ka ngana anō."

msgid "The updates could not be downloaded. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tikiake ngā whakahōunga. Ngana anō, rapua rānei he tautoko."

msgid "The update transaction could not be prepared. Please try again or seek support."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te whakarite te tauwhitinga whakahōu. Ngana anō, rapua rānei he tautoko."

msgid "The update could not start because sleep prevention could not be enabled. Please try again."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tīmata te whakahōunga nā te kore e taea te whakahohe i te ārai moe. Ngana anō."

msgid "The package database could not be locked. Close other package managers and check that the filesystem is writable, then try again."
msgstr "Kāore i taea te maukati te pātengi raraunga mōkī. Katia ētahi atu kaiwhakahaere mōkī, tirohia ka taea te tuhi ki te pūnaha kōnae, ka ngana anō."

msgid "Estimated time: %1"
msgstr "Wā whakatau tata: %1"
